# Memory sidecar

Contract: `docs/context_system_scope.md`.

Four tools only: `recall` · `upsert_person` · `log_interaction` · `brief`.
SQLite + JSON columns. No vector store for the demo.

```python
# recall / brief: local, <150ms, no LLM, no Exa
# unknown face → {"unknown": True}  (never camera-lookup a stranger)
# heard-name enroll: face_ref=None
```

Run: `uvicorn memory.api:app --port 7777`. Self-check: `python memory/api.py`.
Seed: `python -m memory.seed`. DB file `memory/mmg.db` is gitignored.

Do not put this API behind the hall. P0 writes are `upsert` + `log`; `brief` paints the card.
Face-ref recall and re-encounter are P2 (`docs/SHIP.md`).
